WEBVTT

00:00:00.730 --> 00:00:04.940
She may have been so worried that 
she closed off her own heart.

00:00:06.100 --> 00:00:08.230
If that's true,

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:11.320
then Aigasaki won't wake up unless 
she's released from the cause.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:14.710
<i>If I can't use magical arts,</i>

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.410
<i>then no one will...</i>

00:00:21.710 --> 00:00:25.460
If Aigasaki were in our position,

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.960
she wouldn't give up.

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.340
She would tell us with her smile,

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:33.730
"I know we can do it."

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:39.010
We'll never give up.

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.900
<b>Magic-Kyun Renaissance!</b>

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:12.980
Magic-Kyun For You!

00:02:18.480 --> 00:02:20.990
Sorry, Kohana.

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:24.370
It's my fault for suggesting 
we do "Sleeping Beauty."

00:02:24.720 --> 00:02:26.560
That's why you fell asleep.

00:02:26.560 --> 00:02:28.370
It's not your fault.

00:02:29.050 --> 00:02:32.360
I know. I know that.

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:38.080
But there's nothing I can do for 
her even though I'm her friend.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:41.090
Even though I love her so much...

00:02:41.090 --> 00:02:43.440
Even though I love her so much,

00:02:43.440 --> 00:02:45.590
I can't do anything for her.

00:02:46.370 --> 00:02:49.350
Kohana... Kohana...

00:02:50.760 --> 00:02:52.970
We all feel the same way.

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:57.780
Tonight, let's take turns 
staying with Aigasaki.

00:02:57.780 --> 00:03:02.910
You're right. Let's talk to her all night.

00:03:04.570 --> 00:03:06.910
I'm sure our words will reach her heart.

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:07.910
Yeah.

00:03:07.910 --> 00:03:08.910
Yeah.

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:13.160
Kohana, we'll be waiting for you.

00:03:18.560 --> 00:03:19.910
Aigasaki.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:22.290
Senpai.

00:03:23.170 --> 00:03:24.730
My little flower.

00:03:25.470 --> 00:03:26.980
Hana-chan-senpai.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.100
Aigasaki-san.

00:03:31.700 --> 00:03:32.870
Aigasaki.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.000
Hey...

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:50.250
Can you hear me, Aigasaki?

00:03:50.990 --> 00:03:56.250
All we can do for you 
right now is talk to you.

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:59.720
I hope you can hear my voice.

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:04.510
I was really worried.

00:04:05.290 --> 00:04:08.980
I decided when I was a kid 
that I'd pursue sculpting.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:11.520
But it wasn't going well.

00:04:12.020 --> 00:04:15.770
I had no idea what to do.

00:04:16.320 --> 00:04:21.280
But you taught me with 
that great smile of yours.

00:04:21.810 --> 00:04:24.280
I learned that there's more than one path.

00:04:26.420 --> 00:04:31.540
You probably have no idea just 
how amazing your smile is.

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:33.660
How much it cheers people up.

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:36.170
How much energy it gives them.

00:04:36.620 --> 00:04:39.420
I love your smile.

00:04:40.020 --> 00:04:42.350
I love you.

00:04:50.100 --> 00:04:51.520
Smile.

00:04:52.100 --> 00:04:55.300
Not for anyone else, but for yourself.

00:04:55.300 --> 00:04:58.190
Show yourself your own smile.

00:04:58.450 --> 00:05:01.690
You'll feel better then.

00:05:08.770 --> 00:05:11.330
Senpai, don't worry.

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:14.140
I brought disinfecting spray.

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:15.860
No matter who or what comes,

00:05:15.860 --> 00:05:17.710
I'll protect you.

00:05:19.360 --> 00:05:22.000
I had a lot of fun solving the problems

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:24.720
submitted to the Hoshi Festival committee.

00:05:25.890 --> 00:05:29.720
We ran around school together 
during breaks and after school

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:35.230
doing all kinds of stuff 
and smiling together.

00:05:35.640 --> 00:05:42.520
It made me so happy because 
I was always with you.

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:47.010
Since I was a kid,

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:49.740
I've always been expected 
to look after my siblings.

00:05:50.160 --> 00:05:53.990
I thought it was my job to 
take care of other people.

00:05:54.400 --> 00:05:57.070
But, when you...

00:05:59.180 --> 00:06:01.440
...took care of me,

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:04.190
it made me really happy.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:05.880
It was my first time.

00:06:06.960 --> 00:06:08.380
Senpai.

00:06:09.030 --> 00:06:12.690
You probably want to rest 
right now, don't you?

00:06:12.690 --> 00:06:15.390
But come back soon.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.150
I'll be waiting for you.

00:06:28.290 --> 00:06:31.240
My little flower, shall we dance?

00:06:32.240 --> 00:06:35.120
One, two, three. One, two, three.

00:06:35.120 --> 00:06:37.930
One, two, three. One...

00:06:41.280 --> 00:06:45.170
It's no use. I can't dance without you.

00:06:46.790 --> 00:06:51.390
You made me realize how I really felt.

00:06:52.330 --> 00:06:56.270
I didn't realize how I felt about dancing.

00:06:56.610 --> 00:06:59.770
The more I dance, the freer my heart feels.

00:07:00.340 --> 00:07:03.770
The more I dance, the more I love dancing.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:08.280
You're always in my heart dancing with me.

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:18.460
You're sleeping because there's 
something making you sad.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.390
Are you crying? Are you shaking?

00:07:22.840 --> 00:07:24.040
Are you scared?

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.130
But it's okay.

00:07:26.690 --> 00:07:28.790
All of us are here for you.

00:07:29.370 --> 00:07:31.050
We'll protect you.

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:38.340
Our dearly beloved, irreplaceable you.

00:07:42.560 --> 00:07:44.320
Don't you think this is mean?

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.730
Hana-chan-senpai, are you dumb?

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:49.570
What is this? What do you think you're doing?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:50.320
You know,

00:07:51.040 --> 00:07:56.330
it's your fault I uncharacteristically 
joined the executive committee.

00:07:59.600 --> 00:08:05.460
But it's not fair that you went to sleep.

00:08:07.040 --> 00:08:10.050
You need to take responsibility

00:08:10.050 --> 00:08:13.470
for dragging me out of my monochrome world.

00:08:19.330 --> 00:08:20.520
Wake up.

00:08:20.980 --> 00:08:24.020
I'd do anything if you would just wake up.

00:08:24.450 --> 00:08:27.440
I'd play slipper ping pong 
and do bamboo shoot squats.

00:08:27.440 --> 00:08:29.140
I'd eat carrots for you.

00:08:29.140 --> 00:08:31.530
I'd even eat a whole raw carrot.

00:08:31.530 --> 00:08:35.280
I wouldn't care if I had to eat only 
carrots for the rest of my life!

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.540
Rin.

00:08:42.190 --> 00:08:45.840
Hana-chan-senpai, what's the 
world you're in right now like?

00:08:45.840 --> 00:08:49.940
Is it full of brilliant and wonderful colors?

00:08:49.940 --> 00:08:50.920
Hey...

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:52.670
Come back.

00:08:53.090 --> 00:08:59.110
This world is definitely way more wonderful.

00:09:04.290 --> 00:09:09.780
Aigasaki-san, there are many 
things I'd like to tell you.

00:09:09.780 --> 00:09:13.320
I may not be able to 
express them well, though.

00:09:14.100 --> 00:09:19.320
I was alone in a dark place until I met you.

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:23.290
Teika was there for me when I was little,

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:25.330
but then we couldn't play together any more.

00:09:25.330 --> 00:09:31.420
It became normal for me to be alone.

00:09:32.450 --> 00:09:36.840
But you gave light to my world.

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:41.600
Thank you. You are important.

00:09:41.600 --> 00:09:43.100
Very important.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:48.150
You're not alone.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.720
You have us.

00:09:55.890 --> 00:10:01.130
Aigasaki, you changed me. You saved me.

00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:06.000
You brought me out of the 
darkness and into the light.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.750
Those words you said to me then...

00:10:09.190 --> 00:10:11.500
I... I...

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:15.630
I love your singing, Ichijoji-kun!

00:10:16.320 --> 00:10:18.630
I'll never forget them.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:23.510
Since I was a child, my brothers have
always praised my singing.

00:10:25.230 --> 00:10:31.400
But they said that I was good at singing 
or that my singing was fantastic.

00:10:32.100 --> 00:10:35.530
You're the only one who said you loved it.

00:10:36.270 --> 00:10:39.860
Meeting you changed me.

00:10:46.870 --> 00:10:50.040
This time, I want to save you.

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:51.570
That's right.

00:10:52.190 --> 00:10:56.880
I'd give up anything if it would wake you.

00:10:57.460 --> 00:11:00.120
If it's what God wants,

00:11:00.120 --> 00:11:04.390
then I wouldn't even mind 
never seeing you again.

00:11:05.410 --> 00:11:07.640
As long as you would be happy...

00:11:15.790 --> 00:11:18.740
Aigasaki, what should I do?

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:21.280
How can I save you?

00:11:21.960 --> 00:11:24.780
How, Aigasaki?

00:11:25.140 --> 00:11:26.210
Aigasaki.

00:11:29.470 --> 00:11:30.470
Kohana.

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:41.970
<i>Silent night, under the moonlight</i>

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:50.320
<i>My dream sings about true love to me</i>

00:11:51.980 --> 00:11:58.750
<i>In this place, I'm always alone</i>

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:02.960
<i>My heart is beating</i>

00:12:02.960 --> 00:12:07.330
<i>Leaving the pain behind</i>

00:12:08.670 --> 00:12:15.440
<i>I want to be on top someday</i>

00:12:16.960 --> 00:12:24.080
<i>I want to reach for the stars</i>

00:12:24.080 --> 00:12:26.390
I love this song.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:30.140
<i>Twinkle star and shooting star</i>

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.240
Aigasaki!

00:12:40.050 --> 00:12:42.390
Magic-Kyun for you.

00:12:44.640 --> 00:12:47.110
Magic-Kyun! Renaissance.

00:12:49.250 --> 00:12:51.540
You're saying magical arts...

00:12:51.860 --> 00:12:54.830
Will reach Hana-chan-senpai's heart?

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:55.290
Yeah.

00:12:55.600 --> 00:12:57.370
Of course.

00:12:57.370 --> 00:13:00.580
My little flower is a sommelier of sparkles.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:02.550
Not words.

00:13:02.930 --> 00:13:06.100
We'll convey our feelings using magical arts.

00:13:06.100 --> 00:13:06.700
Yeah.

00:13:06.700 --> 00:13:07.220
Yeah.

00:13:08.540 --> 00:13:09.930
Guys.

00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:11.930
Let's hold an art session.

00:13:12.390 --> 00:13:16.940
Let's hold the greatest 
session we can for Aigasaki.

00:13:30.130 --> 00:13:36.670
<i>While you're dreaming, behind those eyes</i>

00:13:36.670 --> 00:13:43.210
<i>I'll stay by your side so you're not alone</i>

00:13:43.210 --> 00:13:49.680
<i>This hand exists to warm yours</i>

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:57.600
<i>This heart exists to protect your heart</i>

00:13:57.600 --> 00:14:06.110
<i>How much has that smile saved me?</i>

00:14:06.110 --> 00:14:09.740
<i>It must be a miracle</i>

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:11.020
<i>Can you hear me?</i>

00:14:11.020 --> 00:14:18.870
<i>Holding the one more important to 
me than anything and everything</i>

00:14:18.870 --> 00:14:22.750
<i>Conveying my feelings through my fingertips</i>

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:27.670
<i>I promise forever</i>

00:14:27.670 --> 00:14:31.760
<i>I'll never go far and hold you tight</i>

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:34.220
<i>Once you wake up</i>

00:14:34.220 --> 00:14:37.460
<i>(Only for you) we'll smile together</i>

00:14:37.460 --> 00:14:40.820
<i>(Only for you) I'll stand by your side</i>

00:14:40.820 --> 00:14:44.770
<i>(Only for you) that's enough for us</i>

00:14:44.770 --> 00:14:48.010
<i>Together forever!</i>

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:58.250
<i>Even if your eyes are closed, I can tell</i>

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:06.270
<i>Being true to yourself is 
more important than anything</i>

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:19.220
<i>Don't forget that your unadorned 
usual self is brilliant on its own</i>

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:11.000
My true self.

00:15:13.750 --> 00:15:18.600
<i>I thought I had to use magical arts.</i>

00:15:19.220 --> 00:15:31.280
<i>But when you still feel uneasy, 
I'll show you and the entire world</i>

00:15:19.250 --> 00:15:24.110
<i>But even if I can't arrange flowers 
anymore or be like my mom,</i>

00:15:24.510 --> 00:15:26.150
<i>I'm still me.</i>

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:31.280
<i>No matter what I do or 
where I am, I'm still me!</i>

00:15:31.280 --> 00:15:34.170
<i>Your appeal and your natural face</i>

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:37.850
<i>You can stay this way forever</i>

00:15:37.850 --> 00:15:42.210
<i>You don't need anything else, don't hesitate</i>

00:15:42.210 --> 00:15:44.050
<i>You are enough</i>

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:47.250
<i>We believe in the same light</i>

00:15:47.250 --> 00:15:51.000
<i>Wherever you go, as many times as it takes</i>

00:15:51.000 --> 00:15:55.050
<i>Your flowers that are more 
wonderful than dreams</i>

00:15:55.050 --> 00:15:57.510
<i>If you want</i>

00:15:57.510 --> 00:16:00.810
<i>(Only for you) I'll keep making them bloom</i>

00:16:00.810 --> 00:16:04.060
<i>(Only for you) gently holding you close</i>

00:16:04.060 --> 00:16:08.020
<i>(Only for you) just that is great enough</i>

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:12.200
<i>You are my special</i>

00:16:19.960 --> 00:16:21.960
<i>I can hear your voices.</i>

00:16:22.370 --> 00:16:23.580
<i>Anjo-senpai.</i>

00:16:23.850 --> 00:16:24.830
<i>Kanato-kun.</i>

00:16:25.270 --> 00:16:26.080
<i>Tsukushi-kun.</i>

00:16:26.450 --> 00:16:27.590
<i>Tatewaki-senpai.</i>

00:16:27.940 --> 00:16:28.600
<i>Aoi-kun.</i>

00:16:29.280 --> 00:16:30.340
<i>Teika-kun.</i>

00:16:30.820 --> 00:16:31.970
<i>Thank you.</i>

00:16:34.650 --> 00:16:38.050
<i>My love for you is overflowing</i>

00:16:38.050 --> 00:16:42.230
<i>I can never tell you enough 
how much I love you</i>

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:47.650
<i>My feelings bloom and spread</i>

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:57.780
<i>I feel like I was born to meet you</i>

00:16:57.780 --> 00:17:01.200
<i>(only for you) I'm so happy I can't help it</i>

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:04.370
<i>(only for you) the beat won't stop pounding</i>

00:17:04.370 --> 00:17:08.450
<i>(only for you) my love for you in my heart</i>

00:17:08.450 --> 00:17:10.710
<i>Together forever</i>

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:16.350
<i>You are my special</i>

00:17:36.410 --> 00:17:38.530
Happy Halloween!

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:40.530
Trick or treat.

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:54.020
0 days until the Halloween party

00:17:41.960 --> 00:17:43.840
There's plenty of candy.

00:17:44.690 --> 00:17:46.860
Senpai, give me some, too.

00:17:45.890 --> 00:17:46.860
Wow.

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:49.680
Hibiki, you just got some candy.

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:54.050
This is fun. This is exciting. This is thrilling!

00:17:50.970 --> 00:17:54.050
Trick or treat.

00:17:54.600 --> 00:17:57.300
Calm down, everyone.

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.930
Don't forget your roles as members 
of the executive committee.

00:18:00.740 --> 00:18:01.680
Sorry.

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:04.280
What are you talking about, Ichijoji?

00:18:04.280 --> 00:18:07.350
It's Halloween. Of course we're celebrating.

00:18:07.590 --> 00:18:10.060
The committee should have fun, too.

00:18:10.060 --> 00:18:12.730
Ichijoji-senpai, if anything, 
you're not celebrating enough.

00:18:13.040 --> 00:18:15.270
Come on, Georgie.

00:18:15.270 --> 00:18:17.390
Why don't you celebrate with us?

00:18:17.390 --> 00:18:17.990
What?

00:18:23.120 --> 00:18:24.880
<b>Hoshinomori Halloween Party</b>

00:18:25.370 --> 00:18:27.240
Episode Zero
Martian Takoyaki

00:18:27.640 --> 00:18:30.250
Wow, isn't this bigger than the last one?

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.830
It's really elaborate.

00:18:33.970 --> 00:18:36.010
We'll heat things up with the parade.

00:18:36.010 --> 00:18:37.590
Let's do our best.

00:18:37.590 --> 00:18:38.610
Yeah!

00:18:38.610 --> 00:18:40.810
Good work, guys. This is for you.

00:18:40.810 --> 00:18:41.890
Thanks.

00:18:42.240 --> 00:18:45.810
Sure thing. Everyone 
loves our pumpkin crepes.

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.760
<b>Pumpkin</b>

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.760
<b>Crepes</b>

00:18:46.140 --> 00:18:47.760
<b>Popcorn</b>

00:18:46.550 --> 00:18:47.770
Welcome.

00:18:48.090 --> 00:18:50.900
Is the costume parade open to everyone?

00:18:50.900 --> 00:18:52.310
Yes.

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:54.480
We'd love to have you join.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:57.860
Mom!

00:18:57.860 --> 00:19:00.340
Event 
Today

00:18:58.450 --> 00:19:00.360
It's okay.

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:01.670
Here.

00:19:04.740 --> 00:19:08.120
Event 
Today

00:19:05.880 --> 00:19:06.910
Butterflies.

00:19:06.910 --> 00:19:08.120
That's right. You can have this.

00:19:08.440 --> 00:19:09.920
Thanks.

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:12.630
It's so pretty.

00:19:13.250 --> 00:19:15.450
This is amazing.

00:19:15.450 --> 00:19:18.000
Not only did she wake up from her slumber,

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:19.790
but she's able to produce 
this beautiful light.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:22.640
There's nothing to worry about anymore.

00:19:23.780 --> 00:19:26.140
I'm looking forward to the future.

00:19:28.620 --> 00:19:32.150
<i>The Halloween parade will now begin.</i>

00:19:32.530 --> 00:19:34.530
Angelo, it's starting.

00:19:34.530 --> 00:19:36.150
What? Already?

00:19:36.150 --> 00:19:38.030
Hurry, hurry.

00:19:38.380 --> 00:19:40.030
Rin Rin, wait.

00:19:41.690 --> 00:19:44.450
The day of the festival 
has gone by in a flash.

00:19:44.450 --> 00:19:47.410
We spent so much time 
preparing for it, though.

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:49.300
Why are you so serious?

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:52.040
Because we're graduating.

00:19:52.040 --> 00:19:54.530
How many more events will we be able to hold?

00:19:54.530 --> 00:19:57.070
The same goes for us.

00:19:57.070 --> 00:19:59.840
We might be chosen to be on 
the committee again next year.

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:00.980
But...

00:20:00.980 --> 00:20:04.050
Not with these members.

00:20:05.750 --> 00:20:08.720
This is the only time the 
six of us have together.

00:20:08.720 --> 00:20:10.060
With different committee members,

00:20:10.400 --> 00:20:12.740
the events won't be the same.

00:20:12.740 --> 00:20:15.490
The present really is precious, isn't it?

